Package: glasses3
Type: Package
Title: Read and Plot 'Tobii Pro Glasses 3' Recordings
Version: 0.2.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Massimiliano", "Canzi", , "massimiliano.canzi@uni-konstanz.de", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6124-0321"))
Description: Reads recordings made with the 'Tobii Pro Glasses 3' wearable
    eye tracker directly from the folder on the SD card, so 'Tobii Pro Lab'
    is not needed. Gaze, pupil diameter, inertial measurement unit and sync
    port data are read from the compressed JSON files into data frames,
    along with the recording metadata. Samples can be aligned with sync
    port pulses and cut into epochs around pulses, API events or any other
    onsets. Further functions fill gaps in the time series, summarise data
    quality per recording or epoch, average samples into time bins, add
    clock time and scene video frame numbers, and convert gaze directions to
    angles and angular velocity. Pupil diameter and gaze position can be
    plotted.
